    91	
    92	Concrete K build and execution:
    93	
    94	```bash
    95	kompile reference-semantics/semantics.k \
    96	  --backend llvm \
    97	  --main-module MPY-KRUN \
    98	  --syntax-module MPY-SYNTAX \
    99	  --output-definition runtime-kompiled
   100	krun solution.mpy --definition runtime-kompiled
   101	krun concrete-tests.mpy --definition runtime-kompiled
   102	```
   103	
   104	Actual results: all exit 0. The LLVM compilation emitted the supplied
   105	definition's non-exhaustive-match and unused-variable warnings. `solution.mpy`
   106	ended with `.K` and the exact `add` closure in module scope. The concrete call
   107	artifact ended with:
   108	
   109	```text
   110	"example_2_3" |-> 5
   111	"example_5_7" |-> 12
   112	"mixed_sign" |-> 5
   113	"zero" |-> 0
   114	```
   115	
   116	Symbolic build and the sole positive target-proof command:
   117	
   118	```bash
   119	kompile verification.k \
   120	  --backend haskell \
   121	  --main-module VERIFICATION \
   122	  --syntax-module MPY-SYNTAX \
   123	  --output-definition verification-kompiled
   124	kprove spec.k \
   125	  --definition verification-kompiled \
   126	  --spec-module SPEC
   127	```
   128	
   129	Actual results: both exit 0; `kprove` printed:
   130	
   131	```text
   132	#Top
   133	```
