   136	`reference-semantics/semantics/str.k`; those rules are not on this proof path.
   137	
   138	False-postcondition probe:
   139	
   140	```bash
   141	kprove spec-vacuity.k \
   142	  --definition verification-kompiled \
   143	  --spec-module SPEC-VACUITY
   144	```
   145	
   146	Actual result: exit 1 with `WarnStuckClaimState`. The failed implication was:
   147	
   148	```text
