+#!/usr/bin/env bash
+set -uo pipefail
+
+if [[ $# -lt 2 ]]; then
+  echo "usage: $0 LOG COMMAND [ARG ...]" >&2
+  exit 64
+fi
+
+log_file=$1
+shift
+
+{
+  printf 'COMMAND:'
+  printf ' %q' "$@"
+  printf '\n'
+} > "$log_file"
+
+"$@" >> "$log_file" 2>&1
+status=$?
+
+printf 'EXIT_STATUS: %d\n' "$status" >> "$log_file"
+exit "$status"

The trust ledger and seven-stage report are complete, evidence artifacts are present, and the required terminal verdict markers were validated.
